{
  "video_id": "w4keiF-4K40",
  "title": "🤯 Stop saying this at restaurants! (3 Essential Phrases) #Shorts",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-20 19:56:18",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.25,
      "end": 3.74,
      "en": "My friend went to a restaurant with her dad.",
      "zh": "我朋友跟她爸爸去餐廳吃飯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.23,
      "end": 8.99,
      "en": "Her dad ordered food for both of them.",
      "zh": "她爸爸幫他們兩個人點了餐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 10.359,
      "end": 14.589,
      "en": "Then the server asked my friend for her\norder.",
      "zh": "接著服務生問我朋友要點什麼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 16.539,
      "end": 18.28,
      "en": "She pointed at her dad",
      "zh": "她指著她爸爸"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 18.28,
      "end": 19.76,
      "en": "and said,",
      "zh": "她指著她爸爸\n然後說："
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 19.76,
      "end": 21.579,
      "en": "\"He has already ordered.",
      "zh": "她指著她爸爸\n然後說：\n「他已經點過了。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 23.859,
      "end": 26.179,
      "en": "And the server brought her a second huge\nmeal!",
      "zh": "結果服務生又幫她送上第二份大餐！"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 27.6,
      "end": 28.92,
      "en": "Oh no,",
      "zh": "天啊，"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 28.92,
      "end": 30.0,
      "en": "that happens!",
      "zh": "天啊，\n這種事真的會發生！"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 30.589,
      "end": 33.579,
      "en": "Saying \"He has already ordered\" is not clear.",
      "zh": "說「他已經點過了」表達得不夠清楚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 34.21,
      "end": 37.0,
      "en": "The server probably thought your friend\nwanted the same dish.",
      "zh": "想要點一樣的餐點。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 37.03,
      "end": 38.77,
      "en": "Yeah,",
      "zh": "沒錯，"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 38.77,
      "end": 40.859,
      "en": "she had to pay for two big meals!",
      "zh": "沒錯，\n她最後得付兩份大餐的錢！"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 41.52,
      "end": 42.939,
      "en": "What should she say instead?",
      "zh": "那她應該怎麼說才對呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 44.09,
      "end": 45.38,
      "en": "Two super clear phrases.",
      "zh": "有兩個超級清楚的句子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 46.469,
      "end": 47.039,
      "en": "First,",
      "zh": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 47.039,
      "end": 48.45,
      "en": "if you are sharing food,",
      "zh": "第一，\n如果你們要分食餐點，"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 48.45,
      "end": 48.71,
      "en": "say:",
      "zh": "第一，\n如果你們要分食餐點，\n就說："
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 48.59,
      "end": 50.28,
      "en": "\"We are sharing,",
      "zh": "「我們一起分著吃，"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 50.28,
      "end": 50.63,
      "en": "thank you.",
      "zh": "「我們一起分著吃，\n謝謝。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 51.38,
      "end": 54.509,
      "en": "We are sharing,",
      "zh": "「我們一起分著吃，\n謝謝。」\n「我們一起分著吃，"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 54.509,
      "end": 55.99,
      "en": "thank you.\"",
      "zh": "謝謝。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 55.99,
      "end": 57.06,
      "en": "That is so clear!",
      "zh": "謝謝。」\n這樣就非常清楚了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 58.99,
      "end": 60.46,
      "en": "What is number two?",
      "zh": "那第二個是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 61.619,
      "end": 63.82,
      "en": "If you do not want anything,",
      "zh": "如果你什麼都不需要，"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 63.82,
      "end": 66.03,
      "en": "just smile and say:",
      "zh": "如果你什麼都不需要，\n只要微笑著說："
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 66.03,
      "end": 66.76,
      "en": "\"I'm good,",
      "zh": "如果你什麼都不需要，\n只要微笑著說：\n「我不用了，"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 66.76,
      "end": 67.14,
      "en": "thank you.",
      "zh": "謝謝。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 68.239,
      "end": 70.299,
      "en": "Wait,",
      "zh": "謝謝。」\n等等，"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 70.299,
      "end": 73.049,
      "en": "what if I actually want the same food as my\ndad?",
      "zh": "謝謝。」\n等等，\n如果我真的想點跟爸爸一樣的餐點呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 74.079,
      "end": 75.48,
      "en": "Then say:",
      "zh": "那就說："
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 75.48,
      "end": 76.64,
      "en": "\"I will have the same,",
      "zh": "那就說：\n「我要一樣的，"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 76.64,
      "end": 76.849,
      "en": "please.",
      "zh": "那就說：\n「我要一樣的，\n謝謝。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 76.849,
      "end": 80.18,
      "en": "And if the server asks,",
      "zh": "如果服務生問你，"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 80.18,
      "end": 82.299,
      "en": "\"Just one for the table?\"",
      "zh": "如果服務生問你，\n「只要一份給這桌嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 82.299,
      "end": 82.78,
      "en": "say,",
      "zh": "如果服務生問你，\n「只要一份給這桌嗎？」\n就說："
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 82.78,
      "end": 83.68,
      "en": "\"Yes,",
      "zh": "「對，"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 83.68,
      "end": 84.12,
      "en": "just one!",
      "zh": "「對，\n只要一份！」"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 85.39,
      "end": 86.43,
      "en": "Got it.",
      "zh": "「對，\n只要一份！」\n學到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 86.43,
      "end": 88.629,
      "en": "So what is the golden rule?",
      "zh": "所以黃金準則是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 89.45,
      "end": 90.95,
      "en": "Golden rule:",
      "zh": "黃金準則："
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 90.95,
      "end": 93.829,
      "en": "Say \"We are sharing,\"",
      "zh": "黃金準則：\n說「我們一起分著吃，」"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 93.829,
      "end": 94.42,
      "en": "\"I'm good,",
      "zh": "黃金準則：\n說「我們一起分著吃，」\n「我不用了，"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 94.42,
      "end": 95.65,
      "en": "thank you,\"",
      "zh": "謝謝，」"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 95.65,
      "end": 97.42,
      "en": "or \"I will have the same.",
      "zh": "謝謝，」\n或是「我要一樣的。」"
    }
  ]
}